          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Garmaadá' iri buúhh, dahamaá baraá do' giri sií'. Aluuwo baabá nay baraá dó wa ti'iít, gway harhheehhe'emisuú áy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala baabuúwós guri báy, ‹Ga/aaweek, án kuúng una sagadiyumamiís kureeriiká' sleémeero, nee qoomár hara'ayaarók ngiwa waaqaá' i káhh. Ala tam deelmoó leei oo naa aní hanís i kaahh, niwa qwalaala/aan nee mulqer'eé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala garmaawók kwí niwa hardáh, oo muruuwók gwa faak dinkwa nee /ameenár tsaatuuse, ugwa awuudá' wahhaár i gás.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo baabá iri oó', ‹Garmaaeé', án nee kuúng a dinkwa umuú deelooro, nee gár án niqo kooma a tók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tawa qwalaala/aan nee tawa bara/aan i hariín, asma hhiyaawók kwí geeraawo aa gwaá', hám naa waasleé/, geeraawo aa qwaár, daxta ugwa slawaán.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
